  "afterChange": "Only markdownviews.nim and markdownparsing.nim changed in an otherwise identical 881e74bf worktree.",
  "workload": "16 distinct Nim fences, 8,192 short lines each; 2,883,958-byte UTF-8 source. Structure parse delivered to UI; render job queued but zero chunks run. Highlight worker retains its code-source payload in both variants.",
